                <pb facs="0226" n="212" xml:id="pg212"/>

                <head>Convention between the United States and the other American Republics
                    concerning the Inter-American Institute of Agricultural Sciences</head>
                <p>[By this convention the Institute, previously incorporated June 18, 1942, under
                    the laws of the District of Columbia, was recognized as having permanent status
                    under the terms of the Convention. For text of the Convention, opened for
                    signature at Washington January 15, 1944, and signed on that date by the United
                    States, see Department of State Treaty Series No. 987, or 58 Stat. (pt. 2)
                    1169.]</p>
            </div>
